zm — your Zoom meetings for agents: transcripts and summaries in a local store, every answer
pointing at its line.

Usage: zm <profile> <command> [options]
Account commands start with your profile, a name you choose; none is ever assumed.

What you can do:
  meetings sync                         meetings, transcripts and summaries into the store
  search meetings "quote"               words across every transcript, with line refs
  meetings context <person>             what past meetings say about one person
  meetings prepare <series-id>          a briefing with sources before a meeting
  meetings transcribe <meeting> <file>  a recording turned into text on this machine
  recordings schedule create …          a daily, checked archive of cloud recordings
  mcp serve                             commands for an MCP agent, limited by the profile’s permissions
  ZM_READ_ONLY=1 zm …                   blocks changes to Zoom, login, settings, files and the store; syncs run

Works with:
  tg                                    Telegram in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  max                                   MAX in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  wa                                    WhatsApp in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  drive                                 Google Drive and Docs as local text, searchable with your other WireCat data
  gcal                                  Google Calendar events, searchable with your other WireCat data
  memo context <person>                 one person across messengers, mail, notes and meetings
  mail                                  IMAP mail in the same local store: search your mailbox offline, next to your other WireCat data

Start here:   zm personal session start  (any profile name works)
Next:         zm commands                every command, by section
              zm guide                   scenarios: command sequences for common tasks
              zm help options            output, offline, timeouts, dry run
For agents:   zm skill show              rules and the discovery loop
